--==============================================================
--  PvB Auto-Keep + Auto-Heart
--  - keeps brainrots off the lane by flipping the AutoSell filter
--  - hearts the kept ones in your bag (matched by name + exact size)
--  - thresholds editable in the little panel (values are in kg)
--==============================================================

